</head>
<body>
  <section id="login-view" class="login-shell">
    <div class="login-art">
      <div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">U<span>D</span></div><span>UniDB</span></div>
      <div class="art-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">UNIVERSITY DATA PLATFORM</span>
        <h1>Every record.<br><em>One campus.</em></h1>
        <p>A unified workspace to manage academic data and explore the power of relational databases.</p>
        <div class="art-stats"><div><strong>05</strong><span>Core tables</span></div><div><strong>05</strong><span>SQL categories</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>Connected campus</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="art-foot">DBMS LAB PROJECT <span>•</span> UNIVERSITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</div>
    </div>
    <div class="login-panel">
      <div class="login-top"><span class="mobile-brand">UD / UniDB</span><span class="secure"><i></i> Secure workspace</span></div>
      <div class="login-card">
        <div class="welcome-icon">↗</div>
        <span class="eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</span>
        <h2>Sign in to UniDB</h2>
        <p class="muted">Enter your credentials to access the database workspace.</p>
        <form id="login-form">
          <label for="username">Username</label><div class="input-wrap"><span>♙</span><input id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" placeholder="Enter your username" required value="admin"></div>
          <label for="password">Password</label><div class="input-wrap"><span>⌑</span><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Enter your password" required value="admin123"><button class="show-pass" type="button" id="toggle-password">Show</button></div>
          <div id="login-error" class="error-msg" role="alert"></div>
          <button class="primary-btn full-btn" type="submit">Sign in to dashboard <span>→</span></button>
        </form>
        <div class="demo-note"><span>✦</span><div><strong>Classroom demo credentials</strong><small>admin / admin123 &nbsp;·&nbsp; faculty / faculty123</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="login-bottom">Built for learning. Designed for clarity.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="app-view" class="app-shell hidden">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="brand side-brand"><div class="brand-mark">U<span>D</span></div><span>UniDB</span></div>
      <div class="side-caption">WORKSPACE</div>
      <button class="nav-item active" data-page="overview"><span>◫</span> Overview</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="explorer"><span>▤</span> Table explorer</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="sql"><span>⌘</span> SQL workspace <b>SQL</b></button>
      <div class="side-caption space-top">DBMS CONCEPTS</div>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="ddl"><span>◈</span> DDL <small>Structure</small></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="dml"><span>✎</span> DML <small>Records</small></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="dql"><span>⌕</span> DQL <small>Queries</small></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="dcl"><span>♙</span> DCL <small>Permissions</small></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-page="tcl"><span>↔</span> TCL <small>Transactions</small></button>
      <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="db-status"><i></i><div><strong>Database connected</strong><small>SQLite · Local instance</small></div></div><div class="user-mini"><div class="avatar">A</div><div><strong id="side-username">Admin</strong><small id="side-role">Administrator</small></div><button id="logout-btn" title="Log out">↪</button></div></div>
    </aside>
    <main class="main-area">
      <header class="topbar"><div class="crumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <strong id="crumb-current">Overview</strong></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>System operational</span><div class="top-avatar" id="top-avatar">A</div></div></header>
      <div class="page-content">
        <section class="page active" id="page-overview">
          <div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SATURDAY, OCTOBER 10, 2026</span><h1>University overview</h1><p>Welcome back. Here's what's happening across your academic database.</p></div><button class="primary-btn" data-goto="sql">＋ Run SQL query</button></div>
          <div class="hero-banner"><div><span class="banner-tag">UNIVERSITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</span><h2>Good data. Better decisions.</h2><p>Manage students, faculty, courses and departments from one place.</p><button class="banner-btn" data-goto="explorer">Explore your tables <span>→</span></button></div><div class="hero-graphic"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="database-cube"><span>▤</span><b>DB</b></div><div class="float-chip chip-one">SQL <small>ready</small></div><div class="float-chip chip-two">FK <small>linked</small></div></div></div>
          <div class="section-head"><div><h3>Database at a glance</h3><p>Live counts from your university database</p></div><span class="tiny-label"><i></i> LIVE DATA</span></div>
          <div class="stat-grid">
            <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-icon purple">♙</div><span>STUDENTS</span><strong id="stat-students">—</strong><small>Student records</small><div class="stat-decoration">↗</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-icon blue">▣</div><span>FACULTY</span><strong id="stat-faculty">—</strong><small>Faculty members</small><div class="stat-decoration">↗</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-icon orange">▤</div><span>COURSES</span><strong id="stat-courses">—</strong><small>Available courses</small><div class="stat-decoration">↗</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-icon green">⌂</div><span>DEPARTMENTS</span><strong id="stat-departments">—</strong><small>Academic departments</small><div class="stat-decoration">↗</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="two-col"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Database tables</h3><p>Your relational data model</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-goto="explorer">View all →</button></div><div id="table-shortcuts" class="table-shortcuts"></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>SQL command guide</h3><p>Five essential command groups</p></div></div><div class="command-list"><button data-goto="ddl"><span class="command-pill c-ddl">DDL</span><span><strong>Define structure</strong><small>CREATE · ALTER · DROP</small></span><span class="chevron">→</span></button><button data-goto="dml"><span class="command-pill c-dml">DML</span><span><strong>Modify records</strong><small>INSERT · UPDATE · DELETE</small></span><span class="chevron">→</span></button><button data-goto="dql"><span class="command-pill c-dql">DQL</span><span><strong>Retrieve information</strong><small>SELECT · WHERE · JOIN</small></span><span class="chevron">→</span></button><button data-goto="dcl"><span class="command-pill c-dcl">DCL</span><span><strong>Manage permissions</strong><small>GRANT · REVOKE concepts</small></span><span class="chevron">→</span></button><button data-goto="tcl"><span class="command-pill c-tcl">TCL</span><span><strong>Control transactions</strong><small>COMMIT · ROLLBACK</small></span><span class="chevron">→</span></button></div></div></div>
        </section>
        <section class="page" id="page-explorer"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RELATIONAL DATABASE</span><h1>Table explorer</h1><p>Inspect table structure, primary keys, and stored records.</p></div><button class="primary-btn" data-goto="ddl">＋ Create a table</button></div><div class="explorer-layout"><div class="panel explorer-list"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Tables</h3><p id="table-count-label">Loading tables…</p></div></div><div id="table-list"></div></div><div class="panel explorer-detail"><div id="table-detail"><div class="empty-state"><span>▤</span><h3>Select a table</h3><p>Choose a table from the left to inspect its columns and records.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-sql"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">QUERY EDITOR</span><h1>SQL workspace</h1><p>Write and execute SQL statements against the university database.</p></div><span class="engine-chip"><i></i> SQLite engine</span></div><div class="panel sql-panel"><div class="editor-top"><div><span class="editor-dot"></span><span class="editor-dot"></span><span class="editor-dot"></span><strong>query.sql</strong></div><span class="editor-language">SQL</span></div><textarea id="sql-editor" spellcheck="false" aria-label="SQL editor" placeholder="-- Write your SQL query here&#10;SELECT * FROM students;"></textarea><div class="editor-bottom"><span>Tip: run one statement at a time</span><div><button class="secondary-btn" id="clear-sql">Clear</button><button class="primary-btn" id="run-sql">▶ Run query</button></div></div></div><div class="quick-queries"><span>QUICK QUERIES</span><button data-query="SELECT * FROM students;">All students</button><button data-query="SELECT s.full_name, d.department_name FROM students s LEFT JOIN departments d ON s.department_id = d.department_id;">Student departments</button><button data-query="SELECT department_id, COUNT(*) AS student_count FROM students GROUP BY department_id;">Group & count</button><button data-query="SELECT * FROM courses;">All courses</button></div><div class="panel result-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Query result</h3><p id="result-subtitle">Your result set will appear here</p></div><span id="result-status" class="result-badge">READY</span></div><div id="query-result" class="result-content"><div class="empty-state compact"><span>⌘</span><p>Execute a query to see rows or execution status.</p></div></div></div><div class="panel history-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Recent queries</h3><p>Your recent statements in this session</p></div><button class="text-btn" id="refresh-history">Refresh</button></div><div id="query-history" class="history-list"><p class="muted">No queries yet.</p></div></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-ddl"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA DEFINITION LANGUAGE</span><h1>Define your structure</h1><p>DDL commands create or change database objects, such as tables and columns.</p></div><span class="command-pill c-ddl large-pill">DDL</span></div><div class="concept-banner"><div class="concept-symbol">◈</div><div><strong>Structure first. Data next.</strong><p>CREATE builds a table, ALTER changes its structure, and DROP removes a table permanently.</p></div></div><div class="operation-grid"><div class="panel operation-card"><span class="op-number">01 / CREATE</span><h3>Create a table</h3><p>Define columns and their data types.</p><label>Table name</label><input id="create-table-name" value="clubs" placeholder="e.g. clubs"><label>Columns (comma-separated definitions)</label><textarea id="create-table-cols" rows="3">club_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, club_name TEXT NOT NULL, department_id TEXT</textarea><button class="primary-btn" id="create-table-btn">Create table →</button></div><div class="panel operation-card"><span class="op-number">02 / ALTER</span><h3>Add a column</h3><p>Add a new column to an existing table.</p><label>Existing table</label><select id="alter-table-name"></select><label>New column name</label><input id="alter-column-name" value="notes" placeholder="e.g. notes"><label>Data type</label><select id="alter-column-type"><option>TEXT</option><option>INTEGER</option><option>REAL</option></select><button class="primary-btn" id="alter-table-btn">Add column →</button></div><div class="panel operation-card danger-card"><span class="op-number">03 / DROP</span><h3>Drop a table</h3><p>Remove a table and all its data. This cannot be undone.</p><label>Table to remove</label><select id="drop-table-name"></select><div class="warning-note">⚠ This operation permanently removes the selected table.</div><button class="danger-btn" id="drop-table-btn">Drop table</button></div></div><div class="panel sql-reference"><h3>DDL reference</h3><div class="reference-row"><code>CREATE TABLE table_name (...);</code><span>Create a database table</span><button data-query="CREATE TABLE example_table (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL);">Use example</button></div><div class="reference-row"><code>ALTER TABLE table_name ADD COLUMN column_name TEXT;</code><span>Add a column</span><button data-query="ALTER TABLE students ADD COLUMN notes TEXT;">Use example</button></div><div class="reference-row"><code>DROP TABLE table_name;</code><span>Delete a table definition</span><button data-query="CREATE TABLE temp_demo (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY);">Try safe demo</button></div></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-dml"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA MANIPULATION LANGUAGE</span><h1>Manage records</h1><p>Insert new data, update existing records, or delete selected records.</p></div><span class="command-pill c-dml large-pill">DML</span></div><div class="notice"><strong>Tip:</strong> Use the form to generate standard SQL, or open SQL workspace for custom INSERT, UPDATE, and DELETE statements.</div><div class="panel operation-card"><span class="op-number">01 / INSERT</span><h3>Insert a student record</h3><p>Add a student to the students table.</p><div class="form-grid"><div><label>Student ID</label><input id="ins-id" placeholder="S104"></div><div><label>Full name</label><input id="ins-name" placeholder="Student full name"></div><div><label>Email</label><input id="ins-email" placeholder="student@example.edu"></div><div><label>Age</label><input id="ins-age" type="number" min="16" max="100" placeholder="19"></div><div><label>CGPA</label><input id="ins-cgpa" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.01" placeholder="8.5"></div><div><label>Department</label><select id="ins-dept"></select></div></div><button class="primary-btn" id="insert-student-btn">Insert student →</button></div><div class="operation-grid two-ops"><div class="panel operation-card"><span class="op-number">02 / UPDATE</span><h3>Update a student</h3><p>Change a student's CGPA using their student ID.</p><label>Student ID</label><input id="upd-id" placeholder="S101"><label>New CGPA</label><input id="upd-cgpa" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.01" placeholder="9.0"><button class="primary-btn" id="update-student-btn">Update record →</button></div><div class="panel operation-card danger-card"><span class="op-number">03 / DELETE</span><h3>Delete a student</h3><p>Remove one student record by ID.</p><label>Student ID</label><input id="del-id" placeholder="S104"><div class="warning-note">⚠ Related enrolments are removed automatically.</div><button class="danger-btn" id="delete-student-btn">Delete record</button></div></div><div class="panel sql-reference"><h3>DML reference</h3><div class="reference-row"><code>INSERT INTO students (...) VALUES (...);</code><span>Add rows</span><button data-query="INSERT INTO students (student_id, full_name, email, age, cgpa, department_id) VALUES ('S104', 'Sample Student', 'sample@example.edu', 19, 8.0, 'DP101');">Load example</button></div><div class="reference-row"><code>UPDATE students SET cgpa = 9.0 WHERE student_id = 'S101';</code><span>Change rows</span><button data-query="UPDATE students SET cgpa = 9.0 WHERE student_id = 'S101';">Load example</button></div><div class="reference-row"><code>DELETE FROM students WHERE student_id = 'S104';</code><span>Remove rows</span><button data-query="DELETE FROM students WHERE student_id = 'S104';">Load example</button></div></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-dql"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA QUERY LANGUAGE</span><h1>Explore your data</h1><p>Use SELECT to retrieve and analyze university records.</p></div><span class="command-pill c-dql large-pill">DQL</span></div><div class="query-cards"><button class="panel query-template" data-query="SELECT * FROM students;"><span>01</span><strong>View all students</strong><small>SELECT *</small><b>→</b></button><button class="panel query-template" data-query="SELECT s.full_name, s.cgpa, d.department_name FROM students s LEFT JOIN departments d ON s.department_id = d.department_id;"><span>02</span><strong>Join departments</strong><small>SELECT · JOIN</small><b>→</b></button><button class="panel query-template" data-query="SELECT department_id, COUNT(*) AS student_count, AVG(cgpa) AS average_cgpa FROM students GROUP BY department_id;"><span>03</span><strong>Aggregate students</strong><small>COUNT · AVG · GROUP BY</small><b>→</b></button><button class="panel query-template" data-query="SELECT * FROM students WHERE cgpa >= 8.5 ORDER BY cgpa DESC;"><span>04</span><strong>Filter by CGPA</strong><small>WHERE · ORDER BY</small><b>→</b></button></div><div class="panel operation-card"><h3>Need a custom query?</h3><p>Open the SQL workspace to use SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY, GROUP BY, HAVING, joins, and aggregate functions.</p><button class="primary-btn" data-goto="sql">Open SQL workspace →</button></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-dcl"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA CONTROL LANGUAGE</span><h1>Access & permissions</h1><p>Demonstrate how roles receive or lose permission to perform operations.</p></div><span class="command-pill c-dcl large-pill">DCL</span></div><div class="notice"><strong>Implementation note:</strong> This project uses SQLite, which does not support native SQL GRANT and REVOKE. The controls below demonstrate the same permission-management concept at the application level.</div><div class="panel permission-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Role permission matrix</h3><p>Grant or revoke a command category for a role.</p></div><span class="tiny-label">ADMIN ONLY</span></div><div class="permission-table-wrap"><table class="permission-table"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>DDL</th><th>DML</th><th>DQL</th><th>DCL</th><th>TCL</th></tr></thead><tbody id="permission-matrix"></tbody></table></div><div class="permission-controls"><div><label>Role</label><select id="perm-role"><option>Faculty</option><option>Administrator</option></select></div><div><label>Permission category</label><select id="perm-category"><option>DDL</option><option>DML</option><option>DQL</option><option>DCL</option><option>TCL</option></select></div><div><label>Action</label><select id="perm-action"><option value="grant">GRANT</option><option value="revoke">REVOKE</option></select></div><button class="primary-btn" id="apply-permission-btn">Apply permission</button></div><div id="permission-message" class="inline-message"></div></div><div class="panel sql-reference"><h3>SQL theory reference</h3><div class="reference-row"><code>GRANT SELECT ON students TO faculty;</code><span>Concept: give permission</span><span class="theory-tag">THEORY</span></div><div class="reference-row"><code>REVOKE INSERT ON students FROM faculty;</code><span>Concept: remove permission</span><span class="theory-tag">THEORY</span></div></div></section>
        <section class="page" id="page-tcl"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">TRANSACTION CONTROL LANGUAGE</span><h1>Transaction control</h1><p>Group SQL changes into transactions and choose whether to commit or roll them back.</p></div><span class="command-pill c-tcl large-pill">TCL</span></div><div class="concept-banner"><div class="concept-symbol">↔</div><div><strong>Keep related changes consistent.</strong><p>COMMIT saves transaction changes. ROLLBACK cancels changes that have not been committed.</p></div></div><div class="transaction-grid"><div class="panel transaction-card"><span class="op-number">01 / BEGIN</span><h3>Start transaction</h3><p>Open a transaction before running your changes.</p><code>BEGIN;</code><button class="primary-btn" data-query="BEGIN;">Begin transaction →</button></div><div class="panel transaction-card"><span class="op-number">02 / COMMIT</span><h3>Commit changes</h3><p>Make changes in the current transaction permanent.</p><code>COMMIT;</code><button class="primary-btn" data-query="COMMIT;">Commit transaction →</button></div><div class="panel transaction-card danger-card"><span class="op-number">03 / ROLLBACK</span><h3>Rollback changes</h3><p>Undo changes made since the transaction began.</p><code>ROLLBACK;</code><button class="danger-btn" data-query="ROLLBACK;">Rollback transaction</button></div></div><div class="panel operation-card"><h3>Practice a complete transaction</h3><p>Open the SQL workspace and execute each statement separately, in order. Use an unused test ID.</p><pre>BEGIN;
INSERT INTO students (student_id, full_name, email, age, cgpa, department_id)
VALUES ('S999', 'Transaction Demo', 'transaction@example.edu', 20, 8.2, 'DP101');
-- Then choose COMMIT; or ROLLBACK;</pre><button class="primary-btn" data-query="BEGIN;">Start in SQL workspace →</button></div><div class="notice"><strong>Note:</strong> A transaction is connection-specific. If the database connection is reset between requests, transaction state may not persist across separate browser requests. For reliable classroom demonstration, run transaction examples within a single persistent database connection or use the TCL controls and verify your environment's behavior.</div></section>
        <footer class="app-footer">UniDB <span>•</span> University Management System <span>•</span> DBMS practical workspace</footer>
      </div>
    </main>
  </section>
  <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status"></div>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
